                "title": "loss-prevention-memo.png",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "MEMORANDUM\n1. No-receipt returns\nA return with no receipt, order number or Rewards ID lookup is limited to $75.00 per transaction and is refunded as store credit only. A customer may make no more than 3 no-receipt returns in any rolling 90 days. The cashier scans the customer’s photo ID into the return screen for every no-receipt return.",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "nemotron-parse-2.0",
