              {
                "rank": 2,
                "score": 0.5705705285072327,
                "vectorScore": 0.5705705285072327,
                "sourceId": "retail.policies",
                "documentId": "retail.policies:f-47d64c78b396828e",
                "chunkId": "retail.policies:f-47d64c78b396828e:0005",
                "title": "loss-prevention-memo.png",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "MEMORANDUM\n3. Enhanced monitoring stores\nThree stores had a return rate more than twice the chain average between January 1 and June 30, 2026 (returned value divided by net sales). They are on enhanced monitoring from August 15 through December 31, 2026:\nS06, Store = Newark Gateway. S06, Region = Northeast. S06, Jan-Jun 2026 return rate = 29.7%. S06, Multiple of chain rate = 3.0x. S22, Store = Los Angeles Westside. S22, Region = West. S22, Jan-Jun 2026 return rate = 29.2%. S22, Multiple of chain rate = 3.0x. S16, Store = Indianapolis Fashion Mall. S16, Region = Midwest. S16, Jan-Jun 2026 return rate = 21.3%. S16, Multiple of chain rate = 2.2x\nThese stores send a daily returns exception report to Asset Protection by 10:00 am, and their no-receipt limit is lowered to $50.00 per transaction. Regional Operations Directors will review the list at the end of the fourth quarter.",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "nemotron-parse-2.0",
