                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n7. Fraud controls\nColleagues must not refuse a legitimate return because of a suspicion they cannot support. Asset Protection monitors return patterns and issues store-specific rules. Stores placed on enhanced monitoring report daily return exceptions to Asset Protection. A customer who makes more than six returns in 90 days is flagged for review but is not refused at the till.",
