                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n6. Approvals and exceptions\nStandard return within the window, Who may approve = Cashier. Standard return within the window, Limit = Up to $250.00 per transaction. Return above $250.00, Who may approve = Store Manager. Return above $250.00, Limit = Up to $1,000.00. Return above $1,000.00, Who may approve = Regional Operations Director. Return above $1,000.00, Limit = No limit. Return up to 7 days outside the window, Who may approve = Store Manager. Return up to 7 days outside the window, Limit = Once per customer per year. Restocking fee waiver, Who may approve = Store Manager. Restocking fee waiver, Limit = Reason code RF-WAIVE; maximum 2 per store per month\nA restocking fee waiver must be recorded with the order number and a short reason. Regional Finance reviews waiver volumes each quarter, and a store that exceeds its limit twice in a row loses waiver authority for 90 days.",
