                "snippet": "MEMORANDUM\n- TO: All Store Managers and Assistant Managers; Regional Operations Directors\n- FROM: Director, Asset Protection\n- DATE: August 12, 2026\n- RE: Return controls and enhanced return monitoring, effective August 15, 2026\n- MEMO NO.: AP-2026-031\nEffective August 15, 2026 the controls below apply in every store, and the stores named in section 3 move to enhanced return monitoring. This memo supplements the Return and Refund Policy (POL-RET-014) and replaces memo AP-2026-018.",
